  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A robotic rover travels across a flat plain in two consecutive stages, P and Q. The motion for each stage is summarized in the table below.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Distance travelled / <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\text{m}\"></span></th><th>Time taken / <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\text{s}\"></span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>P</td><td>120</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>Q</td><td>120</td><td>20</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the average speed of the rover for the entire journey (Stage P and Stage Q combined)?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6.0\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8.0\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"9.0\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"12\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
  },
